    "bbox": [
      67.2,
      151.33,
      309.71,
      177.8
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      67.2,
      196.07,
      309.71,
      222.8
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Sri Lanka Institute of Architects (Amendment) Act, No. of 2025.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      67.2,
      241.07,
      309.71,
      312.8
    ],
    "text": "2. Section 7 of the Sri Lanka Institute of Architects Law, No. 1 of 1976 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is hereby amended in subsection (1) thereof, by the substitution for all the words starting from \u201cThe corporate members\u201d to the word, \u201cAssociates:\u201d of the following:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      67.2,
      331.33,
      309.72,
      432.8
    ],
    "text": "\u201cWith effect from the date of coming into operation of this Act, the corporate members of the Institute shall consist of Fellows and Members:\u201d. 3. Section 12 of the principal enactment is hereby amended as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      91.2,
      451.33,
      309.71,
      507.8
    ],
    "text": "(1) in subsection (1) thereof, by the substitution for the words \u201cand an Associate the initials \u201cA.I.A (Sri Lanka)\u201d.\u201d of the words \u201cand a Member the initials \u201cM.I.A (Sri Lanka)\u201d.\u201d ;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      91.2,
      526.33,
      309.7,
      552.8
    ],
    "text": "(2) by the repeal of subsection (4) thereof, and the substitution therefor of the following :-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      51.44,
      241.1,
      56.44,
      254.24
    ],
    "text": "5",
    "fonts": [
