    ],
    "text": "20",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      78.16,
      45.82,
      301.23,
      59.31
    ],
    "text": "Sri Lanka Institute of Architects (Amendment)2",
    "fonts": [
      "MinionPro-Regular",
      "Times-Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      119.52,
      82.0,
      320.05,
      202.27
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(4) Except as provided in this section, no person or body of persons shall take or use the title \u201cChartered Architect\u201d or \u201cChartered Architects\u201d or the initials \u201cF.I.A (Sri Lanka)\u201d or \u201cM.I.A (Sri Lanka)\u201d, or use the same as the name or part of the name in any book, journal or other publication, dealing with architecture, design or the practice of architecture or the profession of architecture.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      77.52,
      217.74,
      320.04,
      297.47
    ],
    "text": "4. For the avoidance of doubts, it is hereby declared that, those who have been enrolled as Associates to the Institute on the day immediately preceding the date of coming into operation of this Act, shall, with effect from the date of coming into operation of this Act, be deemed to be members of the Institute.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      77.52,
      312.94,
      320.04,
      338.27
    ],
    "text": "5. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhala and Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      324.43,
      219.33,
      369.75,
      238.11
    ],
    "text": "Avoidance of doubts",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      324.43,
      315.13,
      367.98,
      353.11
    ],
    "text": "Sinhala text to prevail in case of inconsistency",
